# Keep build contexts lean and secrets out of images.
.git
.gitignore
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/htmlcov
**/.coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.turbo
**/*.log
.env
.env.local
README.md
